				</div><div class="largetext" style="text-align:justify">Based on 407,944,157 shares of Common Stock of the Issuer issued and outstanding as of August 25, 2025, as set forth in the Issuer's Preliminary Proxy Statement on Schedule 14A filed on August 28, 2025.  Aggregate amount beneficially owned includes 2,500 shares of the Issuer's Series A Convertible Preferred Stock, initially convertible into Common Stock at a rate of 100 shares per $1,000 of liquidation preference, and 1,587,302 warrants, exercisable at any time at the option of the holder thereof for an equal number of fully paid and non-assessable shares of the Common Stock.</div></div></div><div class="form1"><table><tr><td class="center"><br><br><p><div align="center" style="font-size:1.2em;">
